OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies pay tribute to teenagers
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to two
OL,7,Fteenagers who died after a car crashed
OL,8,Finto a lamppost in Rotherham.
OL,10,FJacob Patching and Jacob Skidmore, both
OL,11,F19, were travelling in a white BMW 3
OL,12,FSeries when the collision happened on
OL,13,FEast Bawtry Road on 26 September.
OL,15,FPatching's family described him as a
OL,16,F"loyal, hardworking, caring and a kind
OL,17,Fyoung man", while Skidmore's relatives
OL,18,Fsaid his loss "left a big hole in our
OL,19,Ffamily that will never close".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
